{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-08 22:10:00', 'title': 'CRL LOSS ALERT: ROSEN, A HIGHLY RECOGNIZED LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - CRL', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NYSE: CRL) BETWEEN MAY 5, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 21, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JULY 18, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED CHARLES RIVER SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-08 17:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ADDYY SPR CRL: THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG REMINDS INVESTORS OF IMPORTANT CLASS ACTION DEADLINES', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NY / ACCESSWIRE / JUNE 8, 2023 / THE LAW OFFICES OF VINCENT WONG ANNOUNCE THAT CLASS ACTIONS HAVE COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF CERTAIN SHAREHOLDERS IN THE FOLLOWING COMPANIES. IF YOU SUFFERED A LOSS YOU HAVE UNTIL THE LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE TO REQUEST THAT THE COURT APPOINT YOU AS LEAD PLAINTIFF.'}{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-08 16:30:00', 'title': 'CHARLES RIVER AND INADCURE ANNOUNCE GENE THERAPY MANUFACTURING COLLABORATION', 'text': "ALDERLEY PARK, ENGLAND--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NYSE: CRL) AND THE INADCURE FOUNDATION, A NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION WHOSE MISSION IS TO SUPPORT THE DEVELOPMENT OF TREATMENTS FOR INFANTILE NEUROAXONAL DYSTROPHY (INAD) AND OTHER FORMS OF PLA2G6-RELATED NEURODEGENERATION (PLAN), TODAY ANNOUNCED A PLASMID DNA MANUFACTURING ALLIANCE. THE COLLABORATION WILL LEVERAGE CHARLES RIVER'S MARKET LEADING CONTRACT DEVELOPMENT AND MANUFACTURING ORGANIZATION (CDMO) EXPERTIS."}{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-08 06:00:00', 'title': 'DEADLINE ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / JUNE 8, 2023 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. ("CHARLES RIVER" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE:CRL) FOR VIOLATIONS OF 10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN MAY 5, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 21, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE JULY 18, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'CRL', 'date': '2023-06-08 05:45:00', 'title': 'CRL LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN CHARLES RIVER LABORATORIES INTERNATIONAL, INC. ("CHARLES RIVER" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: CRL) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF CHARLES RIVER INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN MAY 5, 2020 AND FEBRUARY 21, 2023.'}